( WDT: Watchdog Timer)
4000_1000 equ    WDT_CTRL                     | Control
  #01 #01 field  WDT_CTRL_ENABLE              | Enable
  #02 #01 field  WDT_CTRL_WEN                 | Watchdog Timer Window Mode Enable
  #07 #01 field  WDT_CTRL_ALWAYSON            | Always-On
4000_1001 equ    WDT_CONFIG                   | Configuration
  #00 #04 field  WDT_CONFIG_PER               | Time-Out Period
  #04 #04 field  WDT_CONFIG_WINDOW            | Window Mode Time-Out Period
4000_1002 equ    WDT_EWCTRL                   | Early Warning Interrupt Control
  #00 #04 field  WDT_EWCTRL_EWOFFSET          | Early Warning Interrupt Time Offset
4000_1004 equ    WDT_INTENCLR                 | Interrupt Enable Clear
  #00 #01 field  WDT_INTENCLR_EW              | Early Warning Interrupt Enable
4000_1005 equ    WDT_INTENSET                 | Interrupt Enable Set
  #00 #01 field  WDT_INTENSET_EW              | Early Warning Interrupt Enable
4000_1006 equ    WDT_INTFLAG                  | Interrupt Flag Status and Clear
